{"id":"qualita_t","lemma":"Qualität","pos":"noun","rank":3607,"glosses":["quality (level of excellence, level of being free from defects)"],"ipa":"/ˌkvaliˈtɛːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/De-Qualit%C3%A4t.ogg/De-Qualit%C3%A4t.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Qualität","plural":"Qualitäten"},"examples":[{"text":"Nicht die Menge macht’s, sondern die Qualität.","en":"It's not the quantity but the quality that matters.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"quantity"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"S"},{"g":"to separate, to sunder"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Qualität ist wichtiger als Quantität.","en":"Quality is more important than quantity.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"important","l":"wichtig"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"quantity"}]},{"text":"Ihre Waren sind von der höchsten Qualität.","en":"Their goods are of the highest quality.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"high, tall","l":"hoch"},null]},{"text":"Tom hat viele bewundernswerte Qualitäten.","en":"Tom has many admirable qualities.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"admirable","l":"bewundernswert"},null]},{"text":"Mir geht Qualität vor Quantität.","en":"I prefer quality to quantity.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"quantity"}]}]}